[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10320.07, "timestamp": "02:52:00", "text": "弹簧和其他所有东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10323.269, "timestamp": "02:52:03", "text": "是的。真是迫不及待了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10324.95, "timestamp": "02:52:04", "text": "那挺好的。让我们来看看。难道你不也……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10327.75, "timestamp": "02:52:07", "text": "印度也有温泉吗？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10331.269, "timestamp": "02:52:11", "text": "他们认为他们会这么做。我不知道。是的，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10332.95, "timestamp": "02:52:12", "text": "我也不确定。但我感觉我好像听到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10334.63, "timestamp": "02:52:14", "text": "这里曾经有温泉，但没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10337.51, "timestamp": "02:52:17", "text": "当然。嗯。里面有桑拿房之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10339.269, "timestamp": "02:52:19", "text": "现在的日本。我不知道是否有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10340.95, "timestamp": "02:52:20", "text": "这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10344.389, "timestamp": "02:52:24", "text": "这里有桑拿，但是马匹"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10346.71, "timestamp": "02:52:26", "text": "很自然，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10349.75, "timestamp": "02:52:29", "text": "人造的。所以它可以建在任何地方，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10352.23, "timestamp": "02:52:32", "text": "但温泉就像天然的。所以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10357.389, "timestamp": "02:52:37", "text": "我觉得挺难找的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10361.67, "timestamp": "02:52:41", "text": "是的，你说得对。嗯。是的，我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10363.01, "timestamp": "02:52:43", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10364.55, "timestamp": "02:52:44", "text": "还可以拍些温泉的照片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10366.389, "timestamp": "02:52:46", "text": "嗯，听起来不错。会有一些"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10366.938, "timestamp": "02:52:46", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5